assistant line=248 text=The universal loop circularity now closes with `#Top`. The whole-function claim is taking longer, so I’m checking whether the issue is merely initial symbolic setup or a shape mismatch preventing that already-proven circularity from firing; I’ll inspect a bounded residual if it does not finish promptly.
